ir\n                <b>"Shopping"</b> tab.\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>'),keywords:["TikTok Shop","TikTok Shop App","TikTok Shop Login","How to Look Through TikTok Shops"]},{question:"How Do I Get TikTok Shop Promo Codes and Free Shipping?",answer:'<div>\n          To obtain <b>TikTok Shop promo codes</b> and <b>free shipping codes</b>:\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <b>\n                Follow <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@tiktokshop_us" rel="nofollow">Official Accounts</a>\n              </b>\n              : Keep an eye on TikTok Shop\'s official promotions.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Engage with Creators:</b> Influencers may share exclusive <b>promo codes</b> during live\n              streams.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>First Order Discounts:</b> New users often receive a <b>promo code for the first order</b>.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Seasonal Sales:</b> Look out for discounts during holidays.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>',keywords:["TikTok Shop Promo Code","TikTok Shop Free Shipping Code","TikTok Shop Promo Code First Order","TikTok Shop Gift Card"]},{question:"Is TikTok Shop Safe and Legitimate to Buy From?",answer:'<div>\n            Yes, <b>TikTok Shop is safe and legitimate</b>. It provides\n            <a href="https://seller-us.tiktok.com/university/essay?knowledge_id=4186564050224897" rel="nofollow">\n              secure payment options\n            </a>\n            and verifies sellers to protect buyers.\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <b>Tips for Safety:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Purchase from verified sellers with positive reviews.</li>\n              <li>Read product descriptions carefully.</li>\n              <li>Use secure payment methods within the app.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>',keywords:["Is TikTok Shop Safe","Is TikTok Shop Legit","Can You Trust TikTok Shop"]},{question:"How Do I Sell on TikTok Shop?",answer:'<div>\n          To start selling on TikTok Shop:\n          <ol>\n            <li>\n              <b>Register as a Seller:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>\n                  Visit the\n                  <b>\n                    <a href="https://seller.tiktok.com" rel="nofollow">TikTok Shop Seller Center</a>\n                  </b>\n                  .\n                </li>\n                <li>Sign up using your TikTok account or email.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Provide Business Information:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Submit necessary documents for verification.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>List Your Products:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Add product details and images.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Promote Your Products:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>\n                  Use videos, live streams, and the\n                  <b>\n                    <a href="https://getstarted.tiktok.com/affiliates" rel="nofollow">TikTok Shop Affiliate Program</a>\n                  </b>\n                  .\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>',keywords:["How to Sell on TikTok Shop","TikTok Shop Seller","TikTok Shop Creator"]},{question:"Can I Sell Digital Products on TikTok Shop?",answer:'<div>\n          Currently, <b>TikTok Shop primarily supports physical products</b>. To sell digital products:\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <b>Check Policies:</b> Review the latest\n              <a href="https://seller-ph.tiktok.com/university/essay?knowledge_id=7654193087743745" rel="nofollow">\n                guidelines in the Seller Center\n              </a>\n              .\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Compliance:</b> Ensure digital products meet TikTok\'s standards.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>',keywords:["Can You Sell Digital Products on TikTok Shop","TikTok Shop Policies"]},{question:"How Do I Add a TikTok Shop Link to My Video?",answer:'<div>\n          To add a shop link to your TikTok video:\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <b>Create Your Video:</b> Record and edit as usual.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Add Link Before Posting:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>\n                  Tap on <b>"Add Link"</b>.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                  Select <b>"Product"</b>.\n                </li>\n                <li>Choose the item from your TikTok Shop listings.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Post Your Video:</b> The product link will appear on your video.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>',keywords:["How to Add TikTok Shop Link to Video","TikTok Shop Integration"]},{question:"How Do I Connect Shopify to TikTok Shop?",answer:"<div>\n          To connect your Shopify store:\n          <ol>\n            <li>\n              <b>Install TikTok App on Shopify:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Go to Shopify App Store.</li>\n                <li>\n                  Install the <b>TikTok channel</b> app.\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Link Accounts:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Follow prompts to connect TikTok and Shopify.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Sync Products:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Select products to feature on TikTok Shop.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Set Up Tracking:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Install TikTok Pixel for analytics.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>",keywords:["How to Connect Shopify to TikTok Shop","Shopify TikTok Shop Integration"]},{question:'How Long Does TikTok Shop Take to Deliver and Can I\n          <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/discover/how-to-track-orders-on-tiktok" rel="nofollow">Track My Order</a>?',answer:'<div>\n          Delivery times vary depending on the seller and shipping method.\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <b>Estimated Delivery:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Provided at checkout or in order details.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Order Tracking:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>\n                  Go to <b>"Orders"</b> in TikTok Shop.\n                </li>\n                <li>Select your order to view tracking information.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>',keywords:["How Long Does TikTok Shop Take to Deliver","TikTok Shop Order Tracking"]},{question:"Why Is TikTok Shop So Affordable?",answer:"<div>\n          TikTok Shop often offers lower prices due to:\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <b>Direct Sales Model:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Sellers can reduce costs by selling directly to consumers.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <b>Promotions and Discounts:</b>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Frequent sales events and promo codes.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <li>\n            <b>High Competition:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Sellers compete on price to attract buyers.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </div>",keywords:["Why Is TikTok Shop So Cheap","TikTok Shop Deals"]},{question:'What Is the TikTok Shop\n          <a href="https://seller-us.tiktok.com/university/essay?knowledge_id=3253210454181634" rel="nofollow">\n            Return Policy\n          </a>\n          and How Do I Cancel an Order?',answer:'<ul>\n          <li>\n            <b>Return Policy:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Varies by seller, but generally allows returns within 14-30 days.</li>\n              <li> Items must be unused and in original packaging.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <b>How to Return:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                Go to <b>"Orders"</b>.\n              </li>\n              <li>Select the item and initiate a return.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <b>Canceling an Order:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li>If the order hasn\'t shipped, you can cancel it from the order details page.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>',keywords:["TikTok Shop Return Policy","How to Cancel TikTok Shop Order","TikTok Shop Refunds"]}];return(0,O.jsx)(tC,{items:r})},tA={container:"container-_utWD6",content:"content-Wq3L8g"},tN=e=>{var{details:t=[],isBot:o}=e,[r,a]=(0,j.useState)(!!o);return(0,O.jsxs)("div",{className:tA.container,children:[(0,O.jsx)("div",{className:tA.title+(r?" text-color-UIText1Display":" text-color-UIText3")+" P1-Semibold  cursor-pointer",onClick:()=>{a(!r)},children:"Discover"}),r&&(0,O.jsx)("div",{className:tA.content+" overflow-y-auto",children:t.filter(e=>{var{name:t,url:o}=e;return!!t&&!!o}).map(e=>(0,O.jsx)("a",{href:e.url,className:"P3-Semibold text-color-UIText3 cursor-pointer no-underline hover:underline",children:e.name},e.name))})]})},tO="LeftPanel",tj=e=>{var{title:t="",subModules:o,currentExpandedId:r,onExpand:a,isBot:i,pageName:_,firstEntrance:s}=e,[l,n]=(0,j.useState)(!!i);return(0,j.useEffect)(()=>{i||r===t||n(!1)},[r,i,t]),(0,O.jsxs)("div",{children:[(0,O.jsx)("span",{className:eJ()("P1-Semibold  cursor-pointer",{"text-color-UIText1Display":l,"text-color-UIText3":!l}),onClick:()=>{n(!l),null==a||a(t),ea({section:"left_panel_footer_title",jump_url:t})},children:t}),(